Third-party code
================

Portions of src/ippon/kernels/metal/gemm_simd.metal and gemm_thin.metal are adapted from MLX
(https://github.com/ml-explore/mlx): the SIMD-group GEMM body from steel/gemm's GEMMKernel::run and the thin
neural-accelerator GEMM. Their Python launch wrappers in kernels/gemm.py compile against the kernel headers
shipped with the installed MLX wheel. The affine unpacking and staged quantized matmul in
src/ippon/kernels/metal/qgemm_affine.metal and qgemm_staged.metal, launched by kernels/qgemm.py, adapt MLX's
dequantize, QuantizedBlockLoaderStaged and qmm_t_nax_staged_impl from quantized_nax.h at commit bff10220
(ml-explore/mlx#4682).
